  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Svelto.Tasks.Example.MillionPoints.Multithreading.MillionPointsCPU_IndependentThreads
  Notes: 'Independent threads strategy (Burst): a coordinator computes back-to-back
    passes into a double buffer and publishes the newest generation. The main thread
    writes and renders the latest completed result through a mapped GPU upload region
    without waiting.'
